elf passes, then `tests/_engine_path.py::engine_root_of` calls `Path(path).resolve()` while `pathlib.Path` is still patched/aliased to `WindowsPath`, producing `NotImplementedError: cannot instantiate 'WindowsPath' on your system` for `\\\\Users\\\\joeoakhart...` paths.\n\nEvidence: the same solo command fails in both /Users/joeoakhart/alm-2340 and the shared /Users/joeoakhart/rebar checkout at current origin/main, so this is a pre-existing baseline validation blocker rather than a child-material regression.\n\nAcceptance: isolate/restore the WindowsPath monkeypatch or make the engine-root guard robust so the solo test and make verify pass on macOS without weakening foreign-engine detection.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":3,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f46c-8a93-2eb9-4913","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Mac baseline verify fails after WindowsPath noop test","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["b40abef3-c978-480f-8246-62a2ab2b4bdd","fb4649ae-6144-4ac5-8d8d-7182f002e8bd"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1789028944989692001,"uuid":"86affdbc-ccdf-4c20-ae0e-15220087c64b"}